435	     * which is always a business day (a weekend effective date is rolled forward to the following
436	     * Monday); when {@link #MAX_OWNERS_PER_DAY} or more existing owners already carry the given
437	     * business day the create is rejected as too many requests. Because a weekend effective date is
438	     * rolled forward, this quota bounds the number of owners that may be registered per business day.
