355	    /**
356	     * The owner's fiscal year, formatted {@code 'FY<YY>'} where YY is the last two digits of the fiscal
357	     * year (which starts on 1 July) that the business-day-adjusted {@code registrationDate} falls in
358	     * (e.g. a registration date of {@code 2026-08-10} yields {@code 'FY27'}). It is a derived,
359	     * non-persistent value; when no {@code registrationDate} is present it is {@code null}.
360	     *
